          fields: ["Headline + subheadline that name the fear:", "Byline (who has the authority to say this?):", "Honest opening + the facts and safeguards:", "Over-delivery + proof copy:"],
          rubric: ["The objection is named in the headline or subheadline, not buried (copy element #8)", "Opens by stating the fear or problem plainly, without minimizing it (trigger #2)", "Gives specific safeguards and at least one way the business goes beyond what's required (triggers #3, #29)", "The proof copy comes after the objection and finishes resolving it (copy element #9, Axiom 13)"],
