        body: "The 'before' hides the flaw, so the first question a buyer asks (“where are you located?”) becomes a reason to doubt. The 'after' raises it bluntly (copy element #8, trigger #2), creates curiosity about what changes people's minds (trigger #19), then resolves the biggest barrier first, exactly as the Magic Stat ad handled installation."
