        body: "Same structure as Gold Space Chains (standards → persistence → turnaround), with the fixes Sugarman names. It's written in 'I' (Axiom 12), the turnaround reason respects every reader (copy element #10), and the refusal shows a real standard (trigger #3) that makes the gift certificate more trustworthy, not less."
